Derived from RepriseOS (https://github.com/lgreitis/osos-lab), forked at
commit 8fc840d591f48aef8b7a0ff8ff20c35cb0d91475, November 2026. Later
upstream changes are ported individually; each port names its upstream
commit in the commit message.
